{"version":1,"content":"<p>朱玲玲次子霍啟山，近月屢傳出與憑藉內地賣座神話大片《封神》中飾演「妲己」、29歲的俄蒙混血女星娜然（Narána Erdynéyeva）拉埋天窗，而這段備受矚目的戀情如今終修成正果，有指二人將於12月12日下午假灣仔五星級酒店舉行結婚酒會，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:55:13.975079+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:11:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:48:36.792442+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:48:36.792442+00:00","content_hash":"8463e127d5519738071cc83dd6ae914722474f4eb470f58e8e97b8a897a2a707","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}